msgid ""
"A filter defines a regular expression which must match a pattern "
"corresponding to a log-in failure or any other expression."
msgstr ""
"Ett filter definierar ett reguljärt uttryck som måste matcha ett mönster som"
" motsvarar ett inloggningsfel eller något annat uttryck."

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Åtgärd"

msgid "An email address to receive ban messages."
msgstr "E-postadress som ska ta emot meddelanden om blockeringar."

msgid "Ban Time"
msgstr "Blockeringstid"

msgid "Ban time"
msgstr "Blockeringstid"

msgid "Ban time in seconds."
msgstr "Blockeringstid i sekunder."

msgid ""
"Can be an IP address, a CIDR mask or a DNS host, separe with space for "
"multiple ip."
msgstr ""
"Kan vara en IP-adress, en CIDR-mask eller en DNS-värd. Avgränsa flera IP-"
"adresser med blanksteg."

msgid "Chain"
msgstr ""

msgid "Create"
msgstr "Skapa"

msgid "Created jail."
msgstr "Jail-regeln har skapats."

msgid "Date & Time"
msgstr "Datum och tid"

msgid "Dest email"
msgstr "Mottagaradress"

msgid ""
"Duration (in seconds) for IP to be banned for. Negative number for "
"'permanent' ban. (604800 = 1 week)."
msgstr ""
"Tid i sekunder som IP-adressen ska blockeras. Ange ett negativt tal för "
"permanent blockering (604800 = en vecka)."

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Redigera"

msgid "Edit jail."
msgstr "Redigera jail-regel."

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Aktivera"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktiverad"

msgid "Fail2ban"
msgstr "Fail2ban"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filter"

msgid "Find time"
msgstr "Sökintervall"

msgid "Ignore IP"
msgstr "Undantagna IP-adresser"

msgid "Jails"
msgstr "Jail-regler"

msgid "Log Path"
msgstr "Loggsökväg"

msgid "Log path"
msgstr "Loggsökväg"

msgid "Max Retry"
msgstr "Högsta antal försök"

msgid "Max retry"
msgstr "Högsta antal försök"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Meddelande"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Namn"

msgid "No jail enabled"
msgstr "Ingen jail är aktiverad"

msgid ""
"Number of matches (i.e. value of the counter) which triggers ban action on "
"the IP."
msgstr ""
"Antal träffar, det vill säga räknarens värde, som utlöser blockering av IP-"
"adressen."

msgid "Only letters, digits, '-' and '_' are allowed (max. 28 characters)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

msgid "Service disabled"
msgstr "Tjänsten är inaktiverad"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar"

msgid ""
"The counter is set to zero if no match is found within 'findtime' seconds. "
"(604800 = 1 week)."
msgstr ""
"Räknaren nollställs om ingen träff hittas inom ”findtime” sekunder (604800 ="
" en vecka)."

msgid ""
"The iptables chain the ban rule is added to. Leave blank to use the default "
"chain (INPUT). Use DOCKER-USER for ports published by Docker containers. "
"Port must then be the container port, not the host port."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The log file to be scanned by the filter.  Leave blank to scan systemd."
msgstr ""
"Loggfil som filtret ska söka igenom. Lämna tomt för att söka igenom systemd-"
"journalen."

msgid "The name of the jail."
msgstr "Jail-regelns namn."

msgid "The port of the jail."
msgstr "Jail-regelns port."

msgid ""
"action_= ban only / action_mw=ban & send an email / action_mwl=ban & send an"
" email with whois report and log lines."
msgstr ""
"action_ = blockera endast / action_mw = blockera och skicka e-post / "
"action_mwl = blockera och skicka e-post med whois-rapport och loggrader."

msgid "fail2ban"
msgstr "fail2ban"
